    <string name="paused_notification_title">Amla is paused</string>
    <string name="paused_notification_text">Tap to turn the equalizer on</string>
    <string name="background_title">Background</string>
    <string name="background_info">Always on keeps the equalizer running even when Amla is closed, with a persistent notification. Smart runs the service only while audio is playing and stops it after silence. Manual starts only when you switch Amla on; swiping Amla away from Recents stops everything.</string>
